WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:04.320
The Wuzhao and we are mortal enemies I have no time to deal with him now.

00:04.400 --> 00:07.200
Not killing him is already good enough tell him to get lost.

00:07.360 --> 00:08.760
Yes.

00:11.600 --> 00:17.040
A few days later qingzhou Army's main force catches up to you you are forced to fight them.

00:17.440 --> 00:22.480
After days of bitter fighting still unable to achieve victory causing morale to gradually collapse.

00:22.680 --> 00:27.080
Many worry the court will later settle accounts and execute them defect one after another.

00:27.160 --> 00:30.320
You unfortunately die tragically in the chaos.

